{
  "name": "HL · Error alerts",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Error alerts (Boss 3 · Workflow 3, from 3.6)\nEvery workflow above (bot, sub-workflow, daily report, Git backup) sets Settings → Error workflow → HL · Error alerts. On any failed automatic run: Telegram alert to Tolu with workflow, node, error, time and run link, plus a row in the Incidents sheet.\n\nAlready imported this in 3.6? Keep that one and just turn on its Incidents sheet node.\n\n**Credentials:** Telegram API in Telegram alert; Google Sheets OAuth2 in Incidents sheet.\n**Placeholders:** YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID, YOUR_SHEET_ID (tab Incidents).\n\nn8n being down can't alert from inside: the uptime monitor on /healthz (3.8) covers that.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "89f27b11-7ede-4819-b8c4-1150a367059a",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -528,
        -234
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "38db51e5-5ec2-4839-bb49-b2b2856786b9",
      "name": "Error Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
